<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6463] Web console: Invalid result on query result with big number</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6463</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Query result with big number values in cell cut that values.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Attached demo project to put in cache big integer values.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Open project and run &lt;b&gt;startup.ServerNodeCodeStartup&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
    Execute query in Web console: &lt;b&gt;SELECT * FROM &quot;CountryCache&quot;.Country&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Big integer value showed in &lt;b&gt;population&lt;/b&gt;. It should not contain 000 in the end of the values.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
